    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... are delighted to present number 82 Chapelgate, a beautifully appointed and light filled second floor two bedroomed 2 bathroom apartment located in one of the most exclusive and sought after gated communities in Drumcondra Village. Situated in a superb location off St. Alphonsus Road, properties in this exceptional development rarely come to the market, especially in such turnkey condition throughout. Behind the handsome exterior lies approximately 78 m² / 839.58 ft² of luxury accommodation complemented by it's bright light-filled interior and many elegant features & stunning skyline views of the city thanks to the generously proportioned west-facing balcony. \r\n\r\nThe internal accommodation is bright and spacious, and you are greeted by the large entrance hallway with wooden flooring where the hot press and a separate additional storage room are discreetly located for added convenience. The living room is sun drenched and has large west facing windows with additional skylights for added natural light. This spacious living and dining room enjoys a feature fireplace for effect and has ample space to entertain. The kitchen is nestled off the sitting room and features modern appliances and a tiled wall. The master bedroom is ensuite, and both bedrooms overlook the large west facing balcony off the living area, offering a stunning city skyline view which includes the original private residence for the religious order. Parking is available by way of one designated parking spot, located just beside the entrance into the building.\r\n\r\nSituated within a secure, gated community, Chapelgate is renowned for its serene environment and proximity to the vibrant Drumcondra village. The development, originally built on the historic grounds of a secluded convent, offers easy access to local amenities, third-level institutions such as Dublin City University, and excellent transport links, including direct bus routes to Trinity College Dublin and University College Dublin. Local schools, sports clubs, and the nearby Andersons Café make this an ideal location for families and alike. The M50, M1, and Dublin Airport are conveniently close, making this location perfect for those who travel frequently.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this wonderful apartment has to offer and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-88 44 690"
      },
